### OneLink API - Local Testing File
### Use with "REST Client" extension (click 'Send Request' above any query)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api

### 1. Sentinel AI Telemetry
GET {{baseUrl}}/sentinel/telemetry

### 2. Evaluate Legitimate Link (PayPal.me)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sentinel/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://paypal.me/alexrivera"
}

### 3. Evaluate Phishing Threat (Homoglyph Attack)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sentinel/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://pаypal.com/signin"
}

### 4. Evaluate Crypto Drainer
POST {{baseUrl}}/sentinel/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://metamask-free-airdrop-claim.xyz/walletconnect"
}

### 5. Register Creator User
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "creator@onelink.bio",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "username": "alexrivera",
  "name": "Alex Rivera"
}

### 6. Login User
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "creator@onelink.bio",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 7. Get Authenticated Profile
# Paste the accessToken returned from request #6 above, or use: {{loginUser.response.body.accessToken}}
@authToken = YOUR_JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Try Accessing Admin Threats without Super Admin Token (Expect 401/403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/security/threats

### 9. Get Preset Themes (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/themes

### 10. Get Public Profile (Hot Path - Redis Cached)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profiles/alexrivera

### 11. Get Authenticated Creator Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Create Social Link for Creator Profile
# Replace :profileId with the creator's profile ID
@profileId = YOUR_PROFILE_UUID_HERE

POST {{baseUrl}}/profiles/{{profileId}}/social-links
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "TWITTER",
  "url": "https://x.com/alexrivera"
}

### 13. Update Custom Theme CSS Tokens
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profiles/{{profileId}}/custom-theme
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bgType": "SOLID",
  "bgValue": "#09090b",
  "btnStyle": "ROUNDED",
  "btnColor": "#27272a",
  "btnTextColor": "#ffffff",
  "fontFamily": "Inter",
  "textColor": "#ffffff",
  "btnRadius": 9999
}

